I earlier had the following error with the following command I executed on
ferret.wcc.edu:

# /> rcp -pr /raid/datatel16 eagles.wcc.edu:/raid
Permission denied.

The solution was to create a .rhosts file in root on eagles.wcc.edu with a
"ferret.wcc.edu" entry.  I also found the ferret entry in eagle's /etc/hosts
was incorrectly misspelled as:

x.x.x.x  ferret.wcc.ed  ferret

so I corrected the entry to:

x.x.x.x  ferret.wcc.edu  ferret


Thanks much for the assistance.


