X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=97227182521308

Hi,

I finally found the problems we had with our workspaces.
Some crappy software from Sun called ToolTalk was using some kind of magic
cookie authentication and that cookie is unsharable or you have to use
ttauth, a cryptic program that's not in the documentation that edits the
cookie for multiple users I think. Anyways I added
dtstart_ttsession="/usr/dt/bin/ttsession -a unix" line to my .dtlogin file
and now everyone has all the workspaces they need.


Cheers.

PD

